{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37181","headline":"严塘经乱书事 二 · 郑啓","name":"严塘经乱书事 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁园皓色月如珪，清景伤时一惨凄。\n未见山前归牧马，犹闻江上带征鞞。\n鲲爲鱼队潜鳞困，鹤处鸡羣病翅低。\n正是四郊多垒日，波涛早晚静鲸鲵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑啓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37181.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37181","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}